      "id": "s0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "DESCRIPTION",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The [[p0]] program examines and manages system extensions.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "systemextensionsctl"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Users should not run [[p0]] under most circumstances; this utility is intended for software developers.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "systemextensionsctl"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Its subcommands are:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[[p1]] | [[p2]]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "developer"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "on"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "off"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Turn developer mode on and off.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "When the computer examines a new system extension, it performs a version check to see if it is the same as a system extension that is already installed. When developer mode is on, this version check is skipped.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0017",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "list"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "List the system extensions and their state. States include:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "activated enabled"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Available for use",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0021",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "activated waiting for user"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Waiting for user approval via System Settings",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0023",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "activated disabled"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Available but currently disabled by the user, can be enabled using System Settings",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0025",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "terminated waiting for uninstall on reboot"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Will be removed at the next computer restart",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "reset"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Forcibly reset system extensions. This removes all system extensions and clears related state.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "EXIT STATUS",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The [[p0]] utility exits 0 on success, and >0 if an error occurs.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "systemextensionsctl"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SEE ALSO",
      "protected": []
